         <rezi:RzExperience1DateBegin>May 2023</rezi:RzExperience1DateBegin>
         <rezi:RzExperience1DateBeginTS>1682899200000</rezi:RzExperience1DateBeginTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience1DateEnd>September 2023</rezi:RzExperience1DateEnd>
         <rezi:RzExperience1DateEndTS>1693526400000</rezi:RzExperience1DateEndTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience1Description>â€¢ Delivered 24+ cinematic soundscapes, focusing on immersive sound design and foley. &#xA;â€¢ Recorded foley for various elements, including heavy armor, gore, blood, monsters, and spells. &#xA;â€¢ Designed environmental and ambient soundscapes to match the tone and atmosphere of each cinematic.</rezi:RzExperience1Description>
         <rezi:RzExperience1IsCurrent>false</rezi:RzExperience1IsCurrent>
         <rezi:RzExperience1Location>n/a</rezi:RzExperience1Location>
         <rezi:RzExperience1Role>Sound Design Collaborator</rezi:RzExperience1Role>
         <rezi:RzExperience2Company>Gunfire Games - Remnant II</rezi:RzExperience2Company>
         <rezi:RzExperience2DateBegin>October 2022</rezi:RzExperience2DateBegin>
         <rezi:RzExperience2DateBeginTS>1664582400000</rezi:RzExperience2DateBeginTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience2DateEnd>December 2022</rezi:RzExperience2DateEnd>
         <rezi:RzExperience2DateEndTS>1669852800000</rezi:RzExperience2DateEndTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience2Description>â€¢ Designed 600+ creature vocalizations and foley effects exclusively using custom field recordings.&#xA;â€¢ Performed extensive foley recording for creatures, utilizing props, vocal performances, and creative sound sources.&#xA;â€¢ Planned and managed the production of audio assets, including organizing Foley recording sessions, overseeing pre-production planning, and sourcing the appropriate Foley props.</rezi:RzExperience2Description>
         <rezi:RzExperience2IsCurrent>false</rezi:RzExperience2IsCurrent>
         <rezi:RzExperience2Location>n/a</rezi:RzExperience2Location>
         <rezi:RzExperience2Role>Sound Design Collaborator</rezi:RzExperience2Role>
         <rezi:RzExperience3Company>Sunwolf Entertainment - Imp Of The Sun</rezi:RzExperience3Company>
         <rezi:RzExperience3DateBegin>August 2020</rezi:RzExperience3DateBegin>
         <rezi:RzExperience3DateBeginTS>1596240000000</rezi:RzExperience3DateBeginTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience3DateEnd>June 2021</rezi:RzExperience3DateEnd>
         <rezi:RzExperience3DateEndTS>1622505600000</rezi:RzExperience3DateEndTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience3Description>â€¢ Developed and organized a planning structure to ensure the audio departmentâ€™s deadlines and key milestones were met&#xA;â€¢ Designed audio assets, including ambience, UI sounds, character SFX and vocalizations.&#xA;â€¢ Designed and edited audio for cinematics, trailers and marketing materials. &#xA;â€¢ Implemented audio assets using Wwise and Unreal Engine.</rezi:RzExperience3Description>
         <rezi:RzExperience3IsCurrent>false</rezi:RzExperience3IsCurrent>
         <rezi:RzExperience3Location>n/a</rezi:RzExperience3Location>
         <rezi:RzExperience3Role>Sound Designer</rezi:RzExperience3Role>
         <rezi:RzExperience4Company>The Audio Hive</rezi:RzExperience4Company>
         <rezi:RzExperience4DateBegin>April 2020</rezi:RzExperience4DateBegin>
         <rezi:RzExperience4DateBeginTS>1585699200000</rezi:RzExperience4DateBeginTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience4DateEnd>September 2024</rezi:RzExperience4DateEnd>
         <rezi:RzExperience4DateEndTS>1725148800000</rezi:RzExperience4DateEndTS>
         <rezi:RzExperience4Description>â€¢ Designed and implemented high-quality audio assets across various media, including video games, films and podcasts.&#xA;â€¢ Oversaw audio post-production tasks such as mixing, editing, recording and audio implementation.&#xA;â€¢ Collaborated with producers, programmers, and animators to deliver immersive soundscapes for an authentic and fitting sound experience.&#xA;â€¢ Managed voice casting, project planning, and resource scheduling for multiple projects. &#xA;â€¢ Mentored junior team members to support their development.</rezi:RzExperience4Description>
         <rezi:RzExperience4IsCurrent>false</rezi:RzExperience4IsCurrent>
         <rezi:RzExperience4Location>n/a</rezi:RzExperience4Location>
         <rezi:RzExperience4Role>Lead Sound Designer</rezi:RzExperience4Role>
         <rezi:RzExperienceItemCount>5</rezi:RzExperienceItemCount>
         <rezi:RzPublicationItemCount>0</rezi:RzPublicationItemCount>
         <rezi:RzSkill0Keywords>Industry Knowledge: Audio Design, Mixing, Foley, Field Recording, Dialogue Editing, Audio Implementation.</rezi:RzSkill0Keywords>
         <rezi:RzSkill1Keywords>Technical Skills: Reaper, Reascripts, Pro Tools, Wwise, Unreal Engine, Izotope RX, DaVinci Resolve, Monday, Google Suite, Microsoft Word, Excel.</rezi:RzSkill1Keywords>
         <rezi:RzSkill2Keywords>Languages: Spanish (Native), English (Fluent).</rezi:RzSkill2Keywords>
         <rezi:RzSkill3Keywords>Interpersonal: Teamwork, Collaboration, Organization and Proactiveness, Adaptability, Time Management, Project Planning.</rezi:RzSkill3Keywords>
         <rezi:RzSkill4Keywords>Coding: Experience creating and modifying Reascripts using LUA and Python with the help of AI.</rezi:RzSkill4Keywords>
         <rezi:RzSkillItemCount>5</rezi:RzSkillItemCount>
         <rezi:RzSummary>Creative Sound Designer with 6+ years of experience crafting audio for video games, film, and animations. Enthusiastic about creating, recording and design custom high quality sounds. Adept at collaborating with multidisciplinary teams, managing sound production pipelines. Quick to learn and adapt to new tools and workflows. Self-motivated, proactive problem-solver with a collaborative, team-oriented mindset. Strong expertise in remote work and collaborating with teams around the world.</rezi:RzSummary>
         <rezi:RzVisa>n/a</rezi:RzVisa>
